      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"rest\"... that sounds so peaceful. but there's no rest in a world that won't leave you alone. even in my sleep, i feel like i'm being watched, judged. it's like i'm stuck in this limbo where i'm not alive but i'm definitely not gone either. it's just a constant, buzzing, horrible existence. i just want the noise to stop completely.",
